{"published_at": "Fri, 02 Oct 2026 13:12:00 +0000", "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://medcitynews.com/2026/10/its-time-we-reframe-healthcare-organizational-culture-using-behavioral-science/\"><img width=\"600\" height=\"386\" src=\"https://medcitynews.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2017/03/GettyImages-536659322-600x386.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto!important;\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://medcitynews.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2017/03/GettyImages-536659322-600x386.jpg 600w, https://medcitynews.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2017/03/GettyImages-536659322-300x193.jpg 300w, https://medcitynews.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2017/03/GettyImages-536659322.jpg 737w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" /></a></p><p>Data, behavioral insights, and experimentation can be used to understand how stress, motivation, and trust shape company culture. Positively changing company culture leads to direct improvements in patient health outcomes, clinician wellbeing, and company performance.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://medcitynews.com/2026/10/its-time-we-reframe-healthcare-organizational-culture-using-behavioral-science/\">It’s Time We Reframe Healthcare Organizational Culture Using Behavioral Science</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://medcitynews.com\">MedCity News</a>.</p>\n", "tags": [], "title": "It’s Time We Reframe Healthcare Organizational Culture Using Behavioral Science", "upstream_id": "https://medcitynews.com/?p=149494", "url": "https://medcitynews.com/2026/10/its-time-we-reframe-healthcare-organizational-culture-using-behavioral-science/"}
